		{
			dependencies: ["7C9901B56D5867D6"]
			description: [
				"&a锇(Osminum)&f矿(osmium_ore/deepslate_osmium_ore)下矿顺路挖，&a原锇(raw_osmium)&f熔炼得&a锇锭(ingot_osmium)&f。"
				""
				"锇锭是&a锇压缩机(osmium_compressor)&f、大量机器和线缆的材料；&a锇块(block_osmium)&f用于堆放。"
				""
				"粉系：&adust_osmium/copper/tin/lead/uranium/iron/gold/lithium/sulfur&f 等都是各处理阶段的中间产物，JEI 查即可。"
